{"ticker":"SBUX","updated":"2026-10-30T23:10:59Z","profile":{"longName":"Starbucks Corporation","shortName":"Starbucks Corporation","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","country":"United States","website":"https://www.starbucks.com","fullTimeEmployees":381000,"marketCap":118183796736,"trailingPE":59.924854,"forwardPE":27.690893,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.082656,"pegRatio":1.16,"targetMeanPrice":109.93103,"targetHighPrice":136.0,"targetLowPrice":82.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.014,"earningsGrowth":0.857,"grossMargins":0.22341,"operatingMargins":0.12919,"profitMargins":0.05172,"totalRevenue":38338301952,"beta":0.975,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":110.51,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":77.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.39},"summary":"Starbucks Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a roaster, marketer, and retailer of coffee internationally. The company operates through three segments: North America, International, and Channel Development. Its stores offer coffee, tea, and other beverages, roasted whole beans and ground coffees, complementary food, packaged coffees, single-serve products, and ready-to-drink beverages; and various food products, such as pastries, breakfast sandwiches, and lunch items. The company also licenses its trademarks through licensed stores, and grocery and foodservice accounts. The company offers its products under the Starbucks Coffee, Teavana, Seattle's Best Coffee, Ethos, and Starbucks Reserve brands. Starbucks Corporation was founded in 1971 and is based in Seattle, Washington.","summary_zh":"星巴克公司及其子公司在國際範圍內作為咖啡烘焙商、行銷商和零售商運營。該公司透過三個部門運作：北美部門、國際部門和通路開發部門。其商店提供咖啡、茶和其他飲料、烘焙全豆和研磨咖啡、輔食、包裝咖啡、單份產品和即飲飲料；以及各種食品，例如糕點、早餐三明治和午餐食品。該公司還透過授權商店、雜貨店和餐飲服務帳戶授權其商標。該公司以星巴克咖啡、Teavana、Seattle's Best Coffee、Ethos 和 Starbucks Reserve 品牌提供產品。星巴克公司成立於 1971 年，總部位於華盛頓州西雅圖。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"餐廳","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":87.84,"h":89.99,"l