I 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-14","period":"2025-09-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922425000114/sbux-20250928.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"In this Annual Report on Form 10-K (\"10-K\" or \"Report\") for the fiscal year ended September 28, 2025 (\"fiscal 2025\"), Starbucks Corporation (together with its subsidiaries) is referred to as \"Starbucks,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our.\"","zh":"在截至 2025 年 9 月 28 日的財年（「2025 財年」）的 10-K 表格年度報告（「10-K」或「報告」）中，星巴克公司（連同其子公司）被稱為「星巴克」、「公司」、「我們」或「我們的」。"},{"en":"Starbucks is the premier roaster, marketer, and retailer of specialty coffee in the world, operating in 89 markets. Formed in 1985, Starbucks Corporation's common stock trades on the Nasdaq Global Select Market (\"Nasdaq\") under the symbol \"SBUX.\" We purchase and roast high-quality coffees that we sell, along with handcrafted coffee, tea, and other beverages and a variety of high-quality food items through company-operated stores (\"stores\" or \"coffeehouses\"). We also sell a variety of coffee and tea products and license our trademarks through other channels, such as licensed stores as well as grocery and foodservice through our Global Coffee Alliance with Nestl S.A. (\"Nestl \"). In addition to our flagship Starbucks Coffee brand, we sell goods and services under the following brands: Teavana , Ethos , and Starbucks Reserve .","zh":"星巴克是全球首屈一指的精品咖啡烘焙商、行銷商和零售商，在 89 個市場開展業務。星巴克公司成立於 1985 年，其普通股在納斯達克全球精選市場（「納斯達克」）交易，代號為「SBUX」。我們透過公司經營的商店（「商店」或「咖啡館」）購買和烘焙我們銷售的高品質咖啡，以及手工製作的咖啡、茶和其他飲料以及各種高品質食品。我們也銷售各種咖啡和茶產品，並透過其他管道授權我們的商標，例如透過我們與雀巢公司（「雀巢」）的全球咖啡聯盟的授權商店以及雜貨店和餐飲服務。除了我們的旗艦星巴克咖啡品牌外，我們還銷售以下品牌的商品和服務：Teavana、Ethos 和 Starbucks Reserve。"},{"en":"Our primary objective is to maintain Starbucks standing as one of the most recognized and respected brands in the world. We believe the continuous investments in our brand and operations will deliver long-term targeted revenue and income growth. This includes expansion of our global store base, adding stores in both existing, developed markets such as the U.S. and in higher growth markets, as well as optimizing the mix of company-operated and licensed stores around the world. In addition, by leveraging experiences gained through our stores and elsewhere, we continue to drive beverage, equipment, process, and technology innovation, including in our industry-leading digital platform. We strive to regularly offer consumers new, innovative coffee and other products in a variety of forms, across new categories and diverse channels.","zh":"我們的首要目標是保持星巴克作為世界上最受認可和尊敬的品牌之一的地位。我們相信，對我們品牌和營運的持續投資將實現長期目標收入和收入成長。這包括擴大我們的全球商店基礎，在美國等現有已開發市場和成長較快的市場增加商店，以及優化世界各地公司自營商店和授權商店的組合。此外，透過利用我們的商店和其他地方獲得的經驗，我們繼續推動飲料、設備、工藝和技術創新，包括我們行業領先的數位平台的創新。我們努力以各種形式、跨新類別和多樣化管道定期為消費者提供新穎、創新的咖啡和其他產品。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Starbucks programs and benefits are open to every partner and designed to strengthen a culture of inclusion that values diverse perspectives and experiences – from strong partner networks to a focus on hiring internally for 90% of retail leadership roles. Our hiring and recruiting practices are competitive, fair and inclusive. They help us hire the strongest candidate for every job, every time. We offer industry-leading benefits, competitive pay, and opportunities for learning and development. When our partners feel good about their future – at Starbucks or beyond – they take care of our customers. Investing in them and prioritizing their experience creates value for everyone.","zh":"星巴克的計畫和福利向所有合作夥伴開放，旨在加強重視多元化觀點和經驗的包容性文化——從強大的合作夥伴網路到注重內部招聘 90% 的零售領導職位。我們的招募和招募做法具有競爭性、公平性和包容性。他們每次都幫助我們為每項工作聘用最優秀的候選人。我們提供業界領先的福利、有競爭力的薪資以及學習和發展的機會。當我們的合作夥伴對自己的未來（在星巴克或其他地方）感到滿意時，他們就會照顧我們的顧客。對他們進行投資並優先考慮他們的經驗可以為每個人創造價值。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our primary competitors for coffee beverage sales are specialty coffee retailers and shops. We believe that our customers choose among specialty coffee retailers and shops primarily on the basis of product quality, brand reputation, service, and convenience, as well as price. We continue to experience direct competition from large competitors in the quick-service restaurant sector and the ready-to-drink coffee beverage market, in addition to both well-established and start-up companies in many international markets. We also compete with restaurants and other specialty retailers for prime retail locations and qualified personnel to operate both new and existing stores.","zh":"我們在咖啡飲料銷售方面的主要競爭對手是精品咖啡零售商和商店。我們相信，我們的客戶主要根據產品品質、品牌聲譽、服務、便利性以及價格來選擇精品咖啡零售商和商店。除了許多國際市場上的老牌公司和新創公司外，我們還繼續面臨來自快餐店領域和即飲咖啡飲料市場的大型競爭對手的直接競爭。我們也與餐廳和其他專業零售商爭奪黃金零售地點和經營新店和現有商店的合格人員。"},{"en":"Our coffee and tea products sold through our Channel Development segment compete directly against specialty coffees and teas sold through grocery stores, warehouse clubs, specialty retailers, convenience stores, and foodservice accounts and also compete indirectly against all other coffees and teas on the market.","zh":"我們透過通路開發部門銷售的咖啡和茶產品直接與透過雜貨店、倉儲俱樂部、專業零售商、便利商店和餐飲服務帳戶銷售的精品咖啡和茶競爭，也與市場上所有其他咖啡和茶間接競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-28","items":[{"name":"North America","val":27373100000,"zh":"北美洲部門"},{"name":"International","val":7819900000,"zh":"國際"},{"name":"Channel Development","val":1871700000,"zh":"通路拓展"}],"total":37184400000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-28","items":[{"name":"Company Operated Stores","val":30744800000,"zh":"公司直營店"},{"name":"Beverage","val":22539900000,"zh":"飲料"},{"name":"Other Products","val":7594600000,"zh":"其他產品"},{"name":"Food","val":7049900000,"zh":"食物"},{"name":"Licensed Stores","val":4350400000,"zh":"特許專賣店"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":2089199999.9999998,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":37184400000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-28","items":[{"name":"US","val":27124700000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":6898900000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"CN","val":3160800000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":37184400000}},"peers":["NKE","COST","DIS","V","WMT"]}}